<SiteLayout title="Renovation Referrals for Brokers & Agents" description="Introduce a buyer who needs to understand a property renovation scope." dark>
<section class="v2-page-hero wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">FOR BROKERS &amp; BUYER’S AGENTS</span>
  <h1>WHEN THE REHAB<br /><span>HOLDS UP THE SALE.</span></h1>
  <div class="v2-page-summary"><p>A buyer can see the potential and still need a clearer view of the work. Introduce Apex to discuss the property’s condition, intended use and renovation scope.</p><a href="/start-your-project/?context=broker" class="v2-button">MAKE AN INTRODUCTION →</a></div>
</section>
<section class="v2-section wrap">
  <div class="v2-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">RENOVATION, CONNECTED.</span><h2>A PROPERTY.<br /><span class="v2-muted">A CLEARER CONVERSATION.</span></h2></div><p>For investors evaluating a flip or rental. A renovation discussion does not confirm a price, appointment, permit, construction agreement or closing date.</p></div>
  <div class="v2-scope-grid">
    <article><span>01</span><h3>Introduce the property</h3><p>Share the location, property type and current condition. Tell us whether your buyer is evaluating a purchase or already owns it.</p></article>
    <article><span>02</span><h3>Explain the intended use</h3><p>Resale and rental goals can lead to different finish choices. Outline the work, budget and timing your buyer wants to discuss.</p></article>
    <article><span>03</span><h3>Discuss the scope</h3><p>Apex can review the proposed rehab with the buyer and discuss what is needed for a site review. The agreed project scope defines any work.</p></article>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:2rem">Introduce the property using your own contact details. The brief includes optional brokerage, acquisition stage and listing-link fields. Only share a buyer’s personal information with their permission in the <a href="/start-your-project/?context=broker">property inquiry</a>.</p>
  <p>Explore <a href="/renovations/investment-properties/">investment property rehab</a>, <a href="/renovations/whole-home/">whole-home renovation</a>, and <a href="/client-experience/">the client experience</a>.</p>
</section>
</SiteLayout>
